## Part 3: Theme Scheme & Data Protocol Handling

### CSS Variable Reset Strategy

Ensure theme consistency across embedded components and iframes.

```css
/* Root theme declaration */
:root {
  --surface-color: #ffffff;
  --on-surface: #1a1a1a;
  --primary-color: #6d4aff;
  --border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
}

/* Dark mode override */
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --surface-color: #1a1a1a;
    --on-surface: #ffffff;
    --border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  }
}

/* Apply to iframe contexts */
iframe {
  color-scheme: light dark;
}
```

### Document Type & Encoding Verification

Add these checks to your build pipeline to prevent rendering inconsistencies.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Your Page Title</title>
  
  <!-- Prevent mixed content issues -->
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" 
        content="default-src 'self'; img-src 'self' https:;">
</head>
<body>
  <!-- Content -->
</body>
</html>
```

