## Part 5: Implementation Checklist

### Pre-Deployment

- [ ] DOCTYPE declared (`<!DOCTYPE html>`)
- [ ] `<html lang>` attribute set
- [ ] No `aria-hidden="true"` on `<body>`
- [ ] All buttons have accessible names
- [ ] Form inputs have associated labels
- [ ] Images have `alt` text (empty for decorative)
- [ ] Color contrast meets 4.5:1 ratio
- [ ] Focus visible on all interactive elements

### Post-Deployment

- [ ] Lighthouse accessibility score ≥ 90
- [ ] Screen reader test passes (NVDA/VoiceOver)
- [ ] Keyboard-only navigation functional
- [ ] No console ARIA warnings
- [ ] ResizeObserver replaces manual measurements
- [ ] Main thread tasks < 50ms during boot

